        "desc_eyebrow": "The Experience",
        "desc_heading": "An evening in the dunes.",
        "desc_heading_accent": "From sunset to starlight.",
        "description": "<p>Escape to the golden dunes for an unforgettable Arabian desert adventure. Experience the thrill of dune bashing as expert drivers navigate the sweeping sands, followed by a scenic photo stop with breathtaking views of the desert landscape.</p><p>Try sandboarding down the dunes and enjoy a traditional camel ride before the desert transforms at sunset. Continue your evening at a welcoming desert camp, where a delicious barbecue dinner awaits under the stars.</p><p>As you dine, enjoy captivating live entertainment including Tanoura dance, belly dance, and an exciting fire show: an immersive evening of adventure, culture, and authentic Arabian hospitality.</p>",
        "tl_eyebrow": "Your Evening",
